# Master branch workflow

- Perform all RockServer implementation, test, documentation, and configuration changes only in the primary checkout `C:\repos\rockserver` on branch `master`.
- Do not create, attach, or use separate Git worktrees for this repository. If the active directory is not the primary checkout or not on `master`, stop and switch there before editing.
- Do not create or use feature branches or detached-HEAD commits for this repository unless the user explicitly overrides this rule in the current task.
